{"is_source_file": true, "format": "JavaScript", "description": "This file defines functions for generating PowerPoint presentations (PPTX) using the PptxGenJS library. It includes utility functions for handling images (including data URLs), applying transforms to data, resolving template placeholders and assets, and orchestrates the creation of slides based on a template model, extracted template data, slide order, and user input data. The main exported function is generatePptx, which creates and returns a PPTX Blob and filename based on the provided data and template.", "external_files": ["./schemaLoader", "../utils/dateFormat"], "external_methods": ["buildTemplateIndex", "getLayout", "getTemplatePlaceholder", "resolveTemplateAssetUrl", "formatDdMmmYyyy"], "published": ["generatePptx"], "classes": [], "methods": [{"name": "isProbablyDataUrl(v)", "description": "Checks if a string appears to be a data URL by testing its start.", "signatures": ["function isProbablyDataUrl(v)"], "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "fileToDataUrl(file)", "description": "Converts a File object or string to a data URL, handling files and string URLs.", "signatures": ["async function fileToDataUrl(file)"], "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "urlToDataUrl(url)", "description": "Fetches a URL and converts the response blob to a data URL.", "signatures": ["async function urlToDataUrl(url)"], "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "applyTransform(value, transformName)", "description": "Applies transformations (e.g., bullets to lines, percentage, currency formatting) to input values based on a specified transform name.", "signatures": ["function applyTransform(value, transformName)"], "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "resolveDeckTitle(wizardData)", "description": "Determines the presentation title, defaulting to 'presentation' if none available.", "signatures": ["function resolveDeckTitle(wizardData)"], "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "safeFileName(name)", "descriptio